                <text type="information">For information on preparing for bushfires go to www.cfs.sa.gov.au.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">Freshening northwesterly winds combined with hot and dry conditions Friday are expected to result in extreme fire danger over parts of the North East Pastoral district. A sharp, strong and gusty cool southwesterly change is expected to move rapidly east in the afternoon. Showers and thunderstorms following the change.</text>
